('8171','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','A Defiler scout came to me with a report of your success, $n.  Well done.$b$bAs you will learn, to win the battle for Arathi Basin, we must be ever vigilant and crush any attempts at Alliance expansion.  Do this, and our victory here is ensured.','0'),
('8181','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','So, you have been speaking with that old dwarf Ironboot and uncovered the lost Mosh\'aru Tablets, have you?  That meddling prospector...$B$BNo matter.  It is too late to save this world.  Hakkar has been reborn, and even now grows in power... deep in the ancient troll kingdom of Zul\'Gurub!  He has come!  And he will rule in blood and terror!$B$BThank you, $N.  Your help has sped the return of the Soulflayer!','0'),
('8182','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You were sent by the prospector, Ironboot?  His kind are wise, and wiser still to bring you to me, for I and the Zandalarian trolls may know a way to defeat the Soulflayer.$B$BSpeak with the trolls of this isle, heed their words, and prepare yourself, $N, for the task before you is soaked in blood.','0'),
('8183','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, the Heart of Hakkar.  So the Soulflayer has been slain!  Our world is saved!$B$B$N, your service to us cannot be overstated.  You truly are a hero of this realm!','0'),
('8187','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Use it well, $c. Show the Hakkari no mercy!','0'),
('8191','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Use it well, $c. Show the Hakkari no mercy!','0'),
('8192','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Use it well, $C. Show the Hakkari no mercy!','0'),
('8195','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent - this set of coins will make a fine addition to our growing collection... one that we will use in the tribe\'s defense against the rise of the Blood God.  You\'ve earned this Honor Token, $N, as well as the thanks of the tribe!','0'),
('8196','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','A fair trade, my friend - please enjoy the luscious fruits of the South Seas, with the tribe\'s blessing.','0'),
('8201','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','You gained the heads!  You have halted the plundering of our gods\' power, and weakened Hakkar!$B$BYour actions are truly heroic, $N.  May the heads of these troll thralls plead to you for mercy long after their blood chills.','0'),
('8222','4','1','0','0','0','1000','0','0','Great job, $N!  Thanks a lot!  I\'m going to make paint from this blood and turn all kinds of cheap junk into glowing treasure!$B$BHere are your tickets, and thanks again!','0'),
('8228','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','There be a Fishin Contest in Booty Bay this Sunday! Here are the rules for ya!','0'),
('8233','5','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Welcome, welcome, welcome!  Please, $N, have a seat and discuss a simple matter with me.$b$bYou see, $N, I\'ve recently lost something dear to me, and to put it bluntly, I want it back at all costs.  There\'s something in it for you, don\'t worry about that!  Oh yes, something very nice.$b$bNow, what say you $N... are you up for some adventure?','0'),
('8234','5','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I see you have Lord Ravenholdt\'s bag.  Why didn\'t you say so, $gboy:girl;?','0'),
('8235','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','It looks like you picked up some of the better fragments.  Perhaps you aren\'t worthless after all.','0'),
('8236','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The key!  I thought it lost forever.  Please, take an enchanted garment from my stores -- they are reserved for rogues of exceptional skill and loyalty.  It should be known that $N is not to be trifled with!$b$b<Jorach opens the bag and is bathed by a golden glow from within.  His eyes widen and he stares...>','0'),
('8237','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8238','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent - this set of coins will make a fine addition to our growing collection... one that we will use in the tribe\'s defense against the rise of the Blood God.  You\'ve earned this Honor Token, $N, as well as the thanks of the tribe!','0'),
('8239','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent - this set of coins will make a fine addition to our growing collection... one that we will use in the tribe\'s defense against the rise of the Blood God.  You\'ve earned this Honor Token, $N, as well as the thanks of the tribe!','0'),
('8240','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent... each bijou we wrest away from the Blood God\'s minions is one step closer we all are to finally defeating them once and for all.  You bring honor to the Zandalar - and yourself - through your noble actions.$B$BRemember $N, you may always destroy the bijous you find in Zul\'Gurub at the altar.  For each one, you will gain recognition and an Honor Token!  Just remember to have an open space in your inventory if you don\'t have one of the tokens already.','0'),
('8241','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','There\'s always room for more fiery flux, junior. Keep it comin\'... unless I tell you to stop.','0'),
('8242','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','There\'s always room for more fiery flux, junior. Keep it comin\'... unless I tell you to stop.','0'),
('8243','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','A fair trade, my friend - please enjoy the blessings of Zanza with our compliments!','0'),
('8250','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','<Sanath sneers at you.>$B$BArch$C Xylem awaits your arrival.','0'),
('8258','5','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','This is a victory to savor, $N!  The demise of Darkreaver should restore the fragile fetters that anchor the spirit realm.$B$BYou have far exceeded what was asked of you, even when you had no notion of reward or compensation.  You are truly a Shaman of worth, my friend.$B$BI know that acting to preserve the spirit realm should be thanks enough, but please - accept this simple gift with my thanks.','0'),
('8259','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, $n... your effort against Darkreaver was extraordinary - an effort, may I add, that deserved a much better reward than you received.  Please, accept this helm as an additional gift to you for your accomplishments in Scholomance.$B$BAgain, thank you.','0'),
('8260','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $n.  As a reward, please take this care package!  Inside it you\'ll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.$b$bAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you\'ll find that these items will become available to you for purchase.  Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.','0'),
('8261','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $n.  As a reward, please take this care package!  Inside it you\'ll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.$b$bAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you\'ll find that these items will become available to you for purchase.  Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.','0'),
('8262','4','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N.  As a reward, please take this care package!  Inside it you\'ll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.$B$BAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you\'ll find that these items will become available to you for purchase.  Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.','0'),
('8263','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $n.  As a reward, please take this care package!  Inside it you\'ll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.$b$bAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you\'ll find that these items will become available to you for purchase.  Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.','0'),
('8264','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $n.  As a reward, please take this care package!  Inside it you\'ll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.$b$bAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you\'ll find that these items will become available to you for purchase.  Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.','0'),
('8265','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N.  As a reward, please take this care package!  Inside it you\'ll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.$B$BAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you\'ll find that these items will become available to you for purchase.  Rations become available when you are Honored with us, and bandages when you are Revered.','0'),
('8271','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','As a hero of the Stormpike, you may choose one item from these recently plun... er, recovered treasures.','0'),
('8272','6','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','How does it feel, $N? How does it feel to crush your enemies and watch their lines break apart? It feels good, doesn\'t it?$B$BYou should be rewarded for this heroic deed, soldier.','0'),
('8273','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Now isn\'t this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, $c? Very interesting indeed. <Oran carefully puts the tablet away and rubs her hands together.>$B$BI thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.','0'),
('8274','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8275','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent, a new recruit answering the call to arms against the silithid. Welcome to Cenarion Hold, $C. I am pleased to see the words of our emissaries are reaching heroes of your caliber. You will find no shortage of opportunities to help us in our efforts here and I expect you\'ll quickly prove to be a valuable ally to our cause.','0'),
('8276','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent, a new recruit answering the call to arms against the silithid.  Welcome to Cenarion Hold, $C.  I am pleased to see the words of our emissaries are reaching heroes of your caliber.  You will find no shortage of opportunities to help us in our efforts here and I expect you\'ll quickly prove to be a valuable ally to our cause.','0'),
('8277','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Cross your fingers, friend!  Here\'s to hoping we can save Noggle!','0'),
('8278','4','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Yes!  It seems to be working, Noggle is coming to.  We owe ya big time!','0'),
('8279','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Yes! These are the parts to the book!  Let\'s get started then, $N.$B$BSwap every third word with words from the second chapter... then swap every other word with words from the first chapter...  Wait, did I get that backwards?','0'),
('8280','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You have my sincere gratitude.  Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage.','0'),
('8281','4','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent!  You\'ve proven to be a valuable ally in preparing for the war against the silithid.  ','0'),
('8282','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Yes!  You brought my satchel back.  And my rare reagents are all here!  I\'ll be in your debt for a long time.','0'),
('8283','113','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent!  With Deathclasp gone we\'re free to use the southern mountain range as a strategic path to circumvent the silithid hives.  Your work is greatly appreciated.','0'),
('8284','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Just as I suspected.  I can decipher individual words in the tablets but they appear to be devoid of any logic or meaning.  It\'s not unknown for Twilight\'s Hammer sects to use a code to hide the meaning of their texts; we\'ll have to go to someone who knows more about this sort of thing.','0'),
('8285','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I see you\'re familiar with my old organization.  You must be with Cenarion Hold.  $B$BYou seek information to use against them?  Come closer, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.','0'),
('8286','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','It is as it should be - the great one has risen. My watch comes to an end...','0'),
('8287','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This is very interesting information indeed, $N.  This sheds some light on the presence of the Twilight\'s Hammer in Silithus and will undoubtedly help us in our struggle against them.  Your efforts will be handsomely rewarded, $c.','0'),
('8288','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Could you be the first to earn favor among the Bronze Flight in a thousand years?','0'),
('8289','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8290','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8291','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You have proven your value to our efforts in Warsong Gulch. Continue to aid the cause and bring me more Marks of Honor. Do this, and you will earn even more of our trust.','0'),
('8293','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The Night Elves and their allies must tremble at even the whisper of your name! For the Horde!$b$bYou have proven your value to our efforts in Warsong Gulch. Continue to rage against the Silverwing Sentinels! Bring me more Marks of Honor!','0'),
('8294','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','<Captain Shatterskull roars in triumph>$B$BHow much more can they withstand? How many more Alliance filth must perish at the hands of the Horde for them to retreat? Only time will tell, $R... ','0'),
('8295','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8296','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8297','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You got the Mark! Great job! I\'ll send the ressources to our quartermasters, who can quickly disperse them to our troops.$B$BThank you, $N. Indeed, performing successful missions like the one you achieved are how wars are truly won.','0'),
('8299','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','<Deathstalker Mortis smiles>$b$bAnother decisive blow has been dealt against our enemies, $n. Thanks to your deeds, Arathi Basin is soon to be taken hold of by the Defilers. ','0'),
('8301','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You are not alone, hero. I will now grant you the ability to deputize others to help you in your quest. If you are to be the champion of your people, you will need assistance in your tasks and duties.','0'),
('8302','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well done, hero. You will now be granted the ability to deputize another Agent of Nozdormu.','0'),
('8303','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You are the hope of Kalimdor, $N.','0'),
('8304','1','1','6','0','0','0','0','0','<Commander Mar\'alith lowers his head in contemplation.>$B$BWhether she is alive or dead, I must do what is right. She must be found. Alas, I am bound by duty to this outpost. Will you help me once more, $N?','0'),
('8306','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','<Commander Mar\'alith clutches at his chest.>$B$BC\'Thun? WHAT is the meaning of all this? What is C\'Thun? How could this fiend have turned my sweet Natalia into the monster that you described?','0'),
('8307','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This book contains several common recipes and a few unusual ones. After browsing through it for a few seconds you spot a recipe that involves sandworm meat.','0'),
('8308','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well this explains a lot. If you ever find a way into Ahn\'Qiraj, keep an eye out for ol\' Brann. I\'m afraid that he\'ll be powerless without his monkey.','0'),
('8309','1','5','0','0','0','0','0','0','I can\'t make heads or tails of these glyphs. I\'ve never seen anything like it! I hope Frankal\'s research can shed some light on this mess.
','0'),
('8310','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Outstanding! Don\'t wander off too far, kid. We might need you to take on another task or two.','0'),
('8311','4','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Wow, you got them all!  You\'re awesome!$B$BThank you for trick-or-treating for me.  Here, take these pumpkin treats - I think you\'ll like them a lot!$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End, $N!','0'),
('8312','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Wow, you got them all!  You\'re awesome!$B$BThank you for trick-or-treating for me.  Here, take these pumpkin treats - I think you\'ll like them a lot!$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End, $N!','0'),
('8313','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Let\'s have a look at that...$B$BThis seems simple enough.  They have their own names for some of the herbs, but those are simple enough to figure out.  Here, let me show you!  ','0'),
('8314','1','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','The reason the dwarves could not decipher the glyphs is because there is nothing to decipher. The shifting outer layer of the prism must properly align with the inner crystal\'s markings in order for the message to be transmitted. Clever...$B$BWhile we should be able to translate this data, we must first unlock the code. There is only one clue on the surface of the prism - assuming the rubbings were transferred correctly - and it looks grim.','0'),
('8315','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I hold 20,000 years of history in my hands, $N!','0'),
('8317','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent! You\'re a life saver. These dumplings turned out to be quite good. Didn\'t really expect such good taste from the Twilight\'s Hammer.','0'),
('8318','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent!  I\'ll stash these away, maybe they\'ll be useful later.','0'),
('8320','1','2','0','0','0','500','0','0','That was a task well performed, $N.  Your slaying of the Twilight geolords must have dealt a grievous blow to the cult.  Let us hope their plans are slowed...','0'),
('8321','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done it!  Vyral is killed!  This can only mean doom for the Twilight Hammer\'s operations in Silithus.  There may be more of them scurrying about, but the blow you dealt to the cult today is one from which they will not easily recover.','0'),
('8322','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Having successfully fought your way inside the inn, you now place the eggs inside the keg.  You can smell the foul odor permeating the air...','0'),
('8323','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent!  I will get to decoding these as soon as possible.  If I find anything of interest I\'ll find some way to get the information to you.','0'),
('8331','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','$N, good day.  I was told you will pit yourself against the Abyssal Council?  If that is so, then listen closely to my next words...','0'),
('8332','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, very good. I\'ve been working on the medallion - now with these last ingredients, I\'ll be done in just a few moments...$B$BThere we are. Here is the medallion, $N.$B$BYou\'ll need to wear this when you activate one of the Twilight\'s Hammer\'s wind stones. Put this on, along with the rest of the twilight trappings, and the Abyssal Council will see you as one of their cultist underlings.','0'),
('8333','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Here you are, $N. One more Twilight medallion of station. Use it well, and I wish you luck against the Abyssal Council!','0'),
('8341','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thanks. Just one moment and I\'ll have that ring ready for you...$B$BThere it is. Now you\'re ready.$B$BBe sure to wear this ring, along with a medallion of station and the rest of the twilight trappings, when you activate a greater wind stone. Do that, and the Abyssal Council will think you one of their servants. Then, perhaps you can lure one into an ambush! ','0'),
('8342','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, I see your convictions are strong. Not many will face that council of fiends!$B$BHere\'s your ring, $N. May your will, and your fortune, stand firm.','0'),
('8343','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','What Huum says is true. I believe I know how to summon a lord of the Abyssal Council! Listen on, and I will explain...','0'),
('8348','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I knew you were a tough $C the minute I saw you walk into Cenarion Hold. Keep it up!','0'),
('8349','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Good to see you again, $C! So you had a medallion made? Good -- you\'ll need that for your next quest...','0'),
('8351','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Yes, that\'s right, $N. I have a very tough task ahead...','0'),
('8352','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You... you did it! You did it, $N! Here! Take this. It\'s the biggest chest we had lying around and I filled it with some of the best stuff we found.','0'),
('8353','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Too funny!  Well done, $N!  Here\'s your treat.$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End!','0'),
('8354','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Too funny!  Well done, $N!  Here\'s your treat.$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End!','0'),
('8355','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Woo-woo!  Well done, $N!  Here\'s your treat.$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End!','0'),
('8356','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You are truly mighty, haha!  Well done, and thanks for being such a good sport.  Here\'s your candy.$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End, $N!','0'),
('8357','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'re quite the dancing machine, $N!$B$BHere\'s your treat for being such a good sport.  Happy Hallow\'s End, and give my best to your sick little friend!  I hope they get better soon.','0'),
('8358','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Woo-woo!  Well done, $N!  Here\'s your treat.$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End!','0'),
('8359','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You are truly mighty, haha!  Well done, and thanks for being such a good sport.  Here\'s your candy.$B$BHappy Hallow\'s End, $N!','0'),
('8360','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'re quite the dancing machine, $N!$B$BHere\'s your treat for being such a good sport.  Happy Hallow\'s End, and give my best to your sick little friend!  I hope they get better soon.','0'),
('8361','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Hah! You did it, $N! The Twilight\'s Hammer will soon be crushed!','0'),
('8362','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done well! That\'s less Templars for me to worry about.$B$BHere you go, $N. Hope there\'s something useful in there for you.','0'),
('8363','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent, $N!  Defeating those Dukes will leave the Twilight\'s Hammer reeling for a while. As promised, here\'s your reward. It\'s some of the better stuff Huum and I have found.','0'),
('8364','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I knew you\'d come through, $N! Here\'s your reward.','0'),
('8367','113','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Your trials have not been easy, but your courage did not escape you and your strength did not fail.  Part with past tokens of victory, $c.  None shall need them as a reminder of your worth.  Stand up straight, $N.  Today you will walk with great pride for you are a hero!','0'),
('8368','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent!  You\'ve shown your worth by defending our operations in Warsong Gulch!  May word of your honor spread far and wide across our lands.','0'),
('8369','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve shown great bravery in protecting our lands in Alterac Valley!  I will tell my superiors of your deeds.','0'),
('8370','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Securing our resources in Arathi is an important task!  You\'ve done well, $N.','0'),
('8371','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'re not one to disappoint, $N!  What you\'ve learned goes beyond petty medals and commendations.  What you\'ve learned is what can only come with experience and the hardening of one\'s temper in the field of battle.$B$BYou\'ve done well, $c.  You\'re a true hero of the Alliance!','0'),
('8372','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well done, $N! You\'ve served the Alliance well.','0'),
('8373','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, it almost smells better around here already.  Almost.$B$BThanks to you, $N, Southshore just might make it through another Hallow\'s End.  Here\'s your treats, with my thanks!  If you run out of candy, I think there\'s a gnome named Katrina Shimmerstar in Ironforge who can sell you more; she\'s only around during Hallow\'s End, I believe.','0'),
('8374','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Good work, soldier! Keep it up and we\'ll have the Horde running all the way back to Orgrimmar.','0'),
('8375','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done your part, $N.  The Alliance cannot let the Horde\'s uncivilized acts to go unchallenged!','0'),
('8383','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You continue to honor the Alliance, $N.  The Horde will be crushed before long if we keep our efforts up.','0'),
('8384','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Good work, soldier! Keep it up and we\'ll have the Horde running all the way back to Orgrimmar.','0'),
('8385','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You live up to yer reputation, $N.  Without people like you, the Alliance wouldn\'t stand a chance against the savage forces of the Horde.','0'),
('8386','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well done, $N! You\'ve served the Alliance well.','0'),
('8387','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Good work, $N!  You should be proud of yourself.  The Alliance invaders must be expelled from Alterac!','0'),
('8388','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You continue to honor the Horde, $N.  I\'m glad to see you haven\'t turned soft.','0'),
('8390','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Securing our resources in Arathi is an important task! You\'ve done well, $N.','0'),
('8391','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Good work, soldier! Keep it up and we\'ll have the Horde running all the way back to Orgrimmar.','0'),
('8392','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $c!  Your efforts will help provide the Alliance with the resources it needs.','0'),
