('8703','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I will swap the gem on the ring for you.  You\'ll find the effect is much more... agreeable.','0'),
('8710','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done well, $C. This is a masterwork hilt... the balance is perfect.$B$BTake your weapon, $N. Wield it with great confidence and vanquish our enemies!','0'),
('8713','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, $N.  Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?','0'),
