('8727','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, $N. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?','0'),
('8731','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I can tell that Krug has little use for paperwork. He signed this in silithid blood!$B$BVery well, $N. I\'ve prepared a set of tasks that should make good use of your skills as a $c.$B$BWith the continued efforts of you and people like you, our enemy will soon be crushed!','0'),
('8732','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Yes, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I\'m sure they\'ll have a cushy job ready for you.$B$BOff you go!','0'),
('8737','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Good job, $N. Here\'s your next assignment.','0'),
('8738','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I\'ll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.','0'),
('8739','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I\'ll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.','0'),
('8740','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well done, $N. The twilight marauders were inflicting an unacceptable number of casualties on our patrols. Here\'s your next assignment.','0'),
('8741','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8742','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $N.$B$BIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds the next age of your people.$B$BYou must wait for the armies of the Horde and the Alliance to arrive in Silithus before you may ring the Scarab Gong. ','0'),
('8744','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The tag on this present reads:$b$bTo $N,$b$bMay your feast of Great-Winter be merry and bright!','0'),
('8745','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.$B$BI have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C\'Thun.','0'),
('8747','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$B$BThe signet ring of the defender will offer superior protection against the forces of evil.$B$BBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.','0'),
('8752','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$B$BThe signet ring of the conqueror will greatly enhance your physical attacks.$B$BBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.','0'),
('8757','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$B$BThe signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities.$B$BBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.','0'),
('8762','4','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You did it!  Huzzah!$B$BMetzen flew back into Greatfather Winter\'s stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago!  The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would.  You\'ve saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster.  Thank you, $N.$B$BListen... because of what you\'ve done here, I want you to have this.  It\'s something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you\'ll get a kick out of it.  Happy Winter Veil!','0'),
('8763','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working. It is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it. A door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!','0'),
('8767','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:$b$bTo a very special $r $c.','0'),
('8768','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This festively-wrapped present has your name on it.$b$bWait, did it just move?','0'),
('8769','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Have a joyous Feast of Great-Winter from your friends at Smokeywood Pastures.','0'),
('8770','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your diligence is as noteworthy as always.','0'),
('8771','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Ashi has been noted.','0'),
('8772','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Zora has been noted.','0'),
('8773','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I\'ve heard good things about your part in the Hive\'Zora attack. Keep up the good work and victory will soon be ours.','0'),
('8774','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.','0'),
('8775','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.','0'),
('8776','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.','0'),
('8777','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.','0'),
('8778','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, yes!  These will come in handy! Much obliged, $N!','0'),
('8779','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8780','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8781','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Oh, excellent! I won\'t have to hear complaints about dull blades anymore. Thank you, $N.','0'),
('8782','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8783','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('8784','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','An exceptional find, $N. Simply marvelous! This will definitely give us some insight into our enemy\'s twisted minds.
','0'),
('8785','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, yes. Just what I needed! I\'ll make a special concoction with this. The silithid won\'t like it one bit!','0'),
('8786','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work. We were in short supply of these, $N.','0'),
('8787','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, yes... I will distribute these to the troops, $N. The Orgrimmar Legion thanks you!','0'),
('8791','1','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','I offer you my highest commendation and your choice of an item of power, $N. You have done the people of Kalimdor a great service.
','0'),
('8792','1','1','1','0','0','1000','1000','0','Throm\'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $N, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.','0'),
('8793','1','1','1','0','0','1000','1000','0','Throm\'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $N, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.','0'),
('8794','1','1','1','0','0','1000','1000','0','Throm\'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $N, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.','0'),
('8795','1','1','1','0','0','1000','1000','0','Hail and well met $g lad : lass;! Good to see so many of the Alliance, such as yourself, $N, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.','0'),
('8796','1','1','1','0','0','1000','1000','0','Hail and well met $g lad : lass;! Good to see so many of the Alliance, such as yourself, $N, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.','0'),
('8797','1','1','1','0','0','1000','1000','0','Hail and well met $g lad : lass;! Good to see so many of the Alliance, such as yourself, $N, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.','0'),
('8799','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working. It is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it. A door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!','0'),
('8800','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Kaldon sent you?  Very well, let\'s see what we can do for you.','0'),
('8801','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','We will leave this place on our own, $GLord:Lady; $N - once we are certain that the evil within has been wholly destroyed. Your journey of legend is almost at an end.','0'),
('8803','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The note on this present reads:$b$bTo $n,$b$bIn hoping this will help you spread warm tidings and holiday cheer to all of Azeroth.$b$bFrom Greatfather Winter','0'),
