('8846','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well then, it\'s settled; here are your supplies, $c. If you wish to do an additional exchange, then I am prepared to authorize it. Just give me the word and I\'ll make it happen.$B$BKeep up the good work, $N. We need all the materiel we can muster if we\'re going to win this thing. If we all do our part, then victory shall be ours for the taking!','0'),
