('9022','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.$B$BWe\'ll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward.','0'),
('9023','1','5','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ravenholdt thanks you, hero! Take your pick!','0'),
('9024','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','I understand Aristan\'s concerns, but I really think he\'s overreacting. Let young men and women do what they will. I think Aristan has forgotten what it means to be young and in love.$b$bBut it would be better not to tell him that. We\'ll humor him.','0'),
('9025','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','While I thought this would be the case, finding out that my suspicions were correct is still unsettling. We must carefully consider our next move.$b$bHere, to repay you for the purchase of the cologne and perfume.','0'),
('9026','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Oh yes, I just got the perfume and cologne in stock recently. It\'s been selling so well, I don\'t know how long I can keep it on the shelves.$b$bIf you ask me, it\'s kind of boring. Everyone smelling the same? It smells great, but still.','0'),
('9027','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Yes, of course. Those fragrances are the hottest items this season. You must be the fifth or sixth person this hour to inquire about them.$b$bI\'m afraid my supplies are all sold out. If you\'d like some, you should speak with Allison, the innkeeper of The Gilded Rose.$b$bYou shouldn\'t waste any time, though. I think you\'ll find the $g cologne:perfume; will be irresistible.','0'),
('9028','11','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','Yes, I made those fragrances. Wonderful smell, isn\'t it? Irresistible.$b$bOnce the warriors of Alliance and Horde alike are smitten with these feelings of love, they will be powerless to stop the rise of the Shadow Council.$b$bThey will be weakened, unprepared. As they worry for their loved ones, they will lose their edge.$b$bThe solution was so simple. Why did it take me so long to come upon it? The weakness of all is through the heart. And there is nothing you can do to stop the inevitable.','0'),
('9030','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9032','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I am so glad that you can see me. Finally someone to talk to!$B$BWill you help us, $N? Help to undo the wrong that we perpetrated and put things to right? If its true that you already have the Top Piece of Lord Valthalaks Amulet, then I think I can point you in the right direction to acquire the other two parts, reunite them and put an end to all of this.$B$BOh, by the way, hello, my name is Bodley. Nice to meet you!','0'),
('9051','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you, $n.  You are brave and wise.$b$bTell me, how did the devilsaur react to the toxin?','0'),
('9052','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The ingredients at last!$b$bWith the Un\'Goro soil I have collected, the toxin is easily concocted...','0'),
('9055','273','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','As you don more of this armor, you will notice that your persona is changing. You will gain a preternatural ability for killing. Perhaps, even, a lust for blood.$B$BLet it be said that I will not be held responsible for what chaos you may invoke...','0'),
('9059','1','1','0','0','0','1000','0','0','Let the rage of the crypt fiend guide your hand, $N.','0'),
('9060','1','1','0','0','0','1000','0','0','A girdle fit for royalty! It\'s ready for you, $N.','0'),
('9063','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You have traveled far to meet with me, $c, and not a moment too soon.','0'),
('9065','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9085','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $n. With the shadows destroyed, it can only be a matter of time before the Lich King decides to recall his necropolises and leave us in peace.','0'),
('9094','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done well, $n. Take your pick of hand protection in thanks for your efforts.','0'),
('9111','1','25','0','0','500','1000','0','0','The vestments are ready, $N. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire.','0'),
('9114','1','25','0','0','500','1000','0','0','The vestments are ready, $N. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire.','0'),
('9116','1','25','0','0','500','1000','0','0','The vestments are ready, $N. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire.','0'),
('9117','1','25','0','0','500','1000','0','0','The vestments are ready, $N. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire.','0'),
('9120','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9121','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You will feel a slight tingle, $N. That sensation means it\'s working. Once complete, you will be able to enter Naxxramas by stepping upon the rune portal in Plaguewood.
','0'),
('9122','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You will feel a slight tingle, $N. That sensation means it\'s working. Once complete, you will be able to enter Naxxramas by stepping upon the rune portal in Plaguewood.
','0'),
('9136','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I am much obliged, $N.$B$B<Rayne bows.>$B$BPlease remember that I am always accepting fronds.','0'),
('9137','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you, $N. Your work is vital to the success of our campaign against the Scourge.','0'),
('9142','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You earned this, scrub. Now, don\'t cry about your orders. Fill \'em or destroy \'em.
','0'),
('9153','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done well, $n. Through these incremental defeats, we shall prevail against this renewed Scourge threat.$b$bRest and recover, but then you must head out to the front again, lest we lose the ground we have gained today.$b$bTo aid you in your further battles, we will make some of our special items available to you in trade for more necrotic runes.','0'),
('9154','1','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','The Argent Dawn placed the call for aid, and you, among others, have answered. There is no time for us to provide you with training. Our faith is placed in your abilities, and that you will join us in throwing back this Scourge threat.','0'),
('9165','5','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','<Dispatch Commander Metz takes the writ and signs it.>$B$BExcellent work, $N. Outstanding even! Take this as a token of our appreciation. No pun intended, scrub.','0'),
('9198','6','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thorium tubes? Gee, thanks.$B$B<Packmaster Stonebruiser throws the stack of thorium tubes into a large pile of assorted junk.>
','0'),
('9211','1','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','<Mataus pockets the gold.>$B$BEnjoy the repair costs, $r. Naxxramas is \'unkind\' to the uninitiated.','0'),
('9229','5','6','274','1','0','0','0','0','It is his ring! But it is destroyed. No other evidence of Ramaladni was found?$B$B<Korfax grimaces.>$B$BThis does not bode well for Ramaladni. The ring, however... it might be salvageable.','0'),
('9230','5','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','Ramaladni himself couldn\'t have done better! Here is the ring, as promised.','0'),
('9232','1','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','<Wilhelm wipes the sweat from his brow.>$B$BThat\'s some hard work! Enjoy the pants, $c. At least you\'ll die in a clean pair now.','0'),
('9247','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9248','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ande\'thoras-ethil. It means; \'May your troubles be diminished,\' in my native tongue.$B$BWear the band proudly and in good health, $N.','0'),
('9249','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9257','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The magnitude of this accomplishment must not be understated, $N. You have done what most would have thought to be impossible. Alas, it was fated. The staff has made its choice...','0'),
('9261','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Hmm. From what you\'ve told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane.  The Argent Dawn appreciates your service.','0'),
('9262','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Hmm. From what you\'ve told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane.  The Argent Dawn appreciates your service.','0'),
('9263','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Hmm. From what you\'ve told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane.  The Argent Dawn appreciates your service.','0'),
