('9302','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I\'m not sure if the intended recipient still lives.$b$bThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...$b$bThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last.','0'),
('9304','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I\'m not sure if the intended recipient still lives.$b$bThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...$b$bThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last.','0'),
('9310','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You say this was taken from a wight attacking the city?$b$bWe have received word about the necropolis base camps that are being summoned by the Scourge. I suspect they were trying to create one in the Undercity. We will have to be vigilant in the future.','0'),
('9317','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you, $n. Here are your consecrated sharpening stones. Use them prudently.','0'),
('9318','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I hope that you will find these items useful in future battles.','0'),
('9319','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Your essence sings with the energy of the flames you found, $n. The fire you encountered is potent, and with the right knowledge, its power can be harnessed...$b$b<The Flamekeeper mutters an incantation in a strange, arcane tongue. then pulls out a glowing bottle.>$b$bAh! Here we are. May this light your path, no matter where you tread.','0'),
('9320','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Here you are, $n. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.','0'),
('9321','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Here you are, $n. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.','0'),
('9322','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Your spirit glows with the warmth of the Kalimdor fires, friend. Is the heat not invigorating?$b$b Once the power fades from you, perhaps these will help rekindle the feeling.','0'),
('9323','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, here you are. A little wearier, a bit dustier, but enlightened! The heat touches us all during this season and unites us; your very being glows with the power of the fires you touched.$b$bAh, but these days enlightenment is taken as a rather poor reward for being sent on a task, I suppose. Take these, then, and enjoy the celebration.','0'),
('9324','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','What\'s this? Unless I\'m mistaken, this flame has been taken from the heart of Orgrimmar itself! The fierce hearts of the orcs and trolls are reflected in its searing heat. What a fine addition to our collection--how brave you are, stealing into the enemy\'s lair to retrieve the sacred flame!','0'),
('9325','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Unless I miss my guess, this fire has been taken from the cliffs of Thunder Bluff! How it sings with the power of the spirits! You are quite the thief, $N. Take this as just payment for your skill. Now, if only we had the flames of all three cities...','0'),
('9326','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Hm... what a strange fire! It is subdued, nearly smoldering, but the heat is intense. And you received this from the Undercity, you say? Fascinating. With the flames of all three cities, who knows what we could accomplish?','0'),
('9330','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','And this brightly-burning fire... you say it came from Stormwind? Remarkable! That must have been quite an adventure! I\'ll pay you for this, of course. If you find anything else like this, be sure to speak with me again.','0'),
('9331','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This hearty flame must be from the halls of Ironforge; it\'s as stalwart as the dwarves themselves. A fine catch, $N. If I had the fires of the other cities... ah, but never mind. Here is your payment.','0'),
('9332','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This fire aches of ancient sorrow, $N. You pulled this from the roots of Teldrassil, you say? Fascinating! Here is a reward for your skill. Return to me should you find anything else like this; I may have a use for it.','0'),
('9333','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done well, $n. Take your pick of hand protection in thanks for your efforts.','0'),
('9334','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I hope that you will find these items useful in future battles.','0'),
('9335','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you, $n. Here are your consecrated sharpening stones. Use them prudently.','0'),
('9336','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Here you are, $n. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.','0'),
('9337','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Here you are, $n. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.','0'),
('9338','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You honor us, $N. With your continued efforts we will overcome all obstacles.','0'),
('9339','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve proven yourself today, $n.$b$bWhile I have little else to give you, I do have this crown; a fitting gift for a conqueror. May it light your way.','0'),
('9341','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','Take this tabard and wear it proudly. Perhaps your deeds might inspire others to take up arms in support of our fight against the Scourge.','0'),
('9343','1','2','0','0','0','0','0','0','Take this tabard and wear it proudly. Perhaps your deeds might inspire others to take up arms in support of our fight against the Scourge.','0'),
('9353','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9365','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve proven yourself today, $n.$b$bWhile I have little else to give you, I do have this crown; a fitting gift for a conqueror. May it light your way.','0'),
('9367','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent! It seems we\'ve appointed dutiful Flamekeepers this year if the bonfires are as well-kept as you claim. Thank you for inspecting them for me; here, take this as a small token of my esteem.','0'),
('9368','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent! It seems we\'ve appointed dutiful Flamekeepers this year if the bonfires are as well-kept as you claim. Thank you for inspecting them for me; here, take this as a small token of my esteem.','0'),
('9378','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9388','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ahhh, so they do still burn. I am glad; it would not do for those fires to burn out before their time. You have done well, $n. Take this with my blessing.','0'),
('9389','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','So you\'ve returned, and you\'ve seen to the emerald flames of the continent. What do you think, mm? A rare and wonderful sight, to be certain. I am aware, however, that tangible rewards are better appreciated... so please, take this for your trouble.','0'),
('9411','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9412','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9413','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9414','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9415','66','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','The Alliance needs every able body they can get. The Horde has been receiving a steady supply of reinforcements from the northern part of the continent, and it\'s been a struggle to keep up.$b$bLet me explain the situation to you.','0'),
('9416','113','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','It\'s good that you\'re hear, but there\'s no time to waste making small talk. You need instructions, and then you need to get out there.$b$bListen up.','0'),
('9419','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank the Light you were successful.$b$bNow if we could only have started this sooner, our need would not be so desperate. We must keep the bounty of the desert from falling into the hands of the Horde.','0'),
('9422','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','You\'ve done well, $n. These resources will be added to our stockpiles, and every bit is to our gain and our enemy\'s loss.$b$b','0'),
('9458','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9459','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9477','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9478','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9479','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9480','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9481','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9482','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9556','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0',NULL,'0'),
('9664','1','1','0','0','0','0','0','0','Very good, $n. It will be important for us to hold these towers against future attacks, and for that we may need your assistance until reinforcements can be brought in to secure the area.','0'),
('9665','1','66','0','0','0','0','0','0','This is good news, $n. It will be a constant struggle here in the Plaguelands until we have fully driven back the forces of the Alliance.$b$bUntil that day, I hope that we will have your continued assistance.','0'),
('92460','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Gale\'s greetings, $n. I am honored to bestow your coming of age relic today as you are recognized for the potential you bring to the shen\'dorei. Our people have faced great hardship and persecution in our complex history.

Today you are given this relic which is one of many held by those before you. Someday when your ashes are scattered to the winds it will pass to another to continue our tradition.

As you take this relic with you know that the winds of home will be with you wherever you travel.','70124'),
('92461','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you for your service to Zephras, young $c.

The vuldren are typically quite docile, but the animals that call Zephras home can sense when the magic on the winds is out of balance, which can lead to dangerous and unpredictable behavior if left unchecked.','70124'),
('92462','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Judging by the amount of bug entrails covering you, this must be quite the infestation.','70124'),
('92463','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Excellent work, $n. You\'d make a fine ranger if this whole "adventurer" thing doesn\'t work out for you.','70124'),
('92464','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Rorian sent you? Good. I could use your aid.','70124'),
('92465','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','It pains me to shed shen\'dorei blood here in the grove, but we do what we must.','70124'),
('92469','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','This is most troubling, but unfortunately unsurprising. We\'ve been aware of the cult\'s movements for some time, but we\'ve been content to watch from afar. Their agitation of the wind spirits near the standing stones is a clear escalation on their part.

You\'ve performed a difficult but necessary service for Thendal Grove, $n. Thank you.','70124'),
('92470','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Very well done. You\'ve felled beasts and laid low cultist interlopers. You have shown great promise but your path must soon take you beyond the relative safety of Thendal Village.','70124'),
('92471','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Rorian has told me much of you. I am likely unknown to you, but I am a member of the Council of Elders here on Zephras Isle. I\'ve come to read the flow of the winds here in Thendal Grove. I\'m also here to assess young shen\'dorei such as yourself that are coming of age.

So tell me, are you ready to take your next step? Are you ready to serve Zephras Isle?','70124'),
('92472','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Aetheen sent you, then? I\'ll confess, you don\'t look like much to me, but Shen\'dar Village won\'t turn down willing aid, much less aid sent from Elder Aetheen herself.','70124'),
('92473','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well done, $c. The Rangers of the Grove are in your debt.','70124'),
('92474','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','How many times do I need to tell Myriaal not to encourage others to make reckless usage of our skyborne gifts!

That being said, I suppose that a little bit of practice in the relative safety of the village is... acceptable.

In the future I\'d simply suggest you to use your ability judiciously. You do not want to exhaust your magic thoughtlessly and then not be able to use it when you truly need it.','70124'),
('92485','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','The flora and fauna of Zephras Isle represent a rich tapestry of vibrant life. The ecosystem requires constant balance to maintain the harmony of nature, and we druids are the keepers of that balance. I see much potential in you, but this path is not an easy one, and you will need guidance as you grow in strength as a student of the fang, the claw, the feather, and the branch. 

Speak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.','70124'),
('92514','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Checked in with Illaya then? Great. Lots of tension between the High Order and the Windshapers these days, but they keep things civil here in Shen\'dar. Everyone here is well aware that we\'ve got bigger problems than their quibbles.

Now that that\'s done, you look like someone who might be looking for something to do with their hands and I\'ve got a bandit problem that I was hoping you could help me with.','70124'),
('92515','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I didn\'t say it wouldn\'t be a dirty job, did I?','70124'),
('92516','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well done, and quickly too. Not too bad at all.','70124'),
('92517','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','With the bandits dispersed, that is one less problem for us to deal with. Though I confess that now I worry that any bandits who survived may turn next to the cult for protection, further bolstering their increasingly alarming numbers.

Still though, we\'ll take the victories where we can get them.','70124'),
('92528','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Lorthuna herself was there? She\'s the leader of the whole damned cult!

If they are making a move on Shen\'dar Village and the western watchtower, we\'ve got to be ready. What is strange is... why the watchtower?

The Village I can understand, but the tower? It doesn\'t have much strategic significance, other than as a minor lookout post.

Regardless, we will be prepared for them. They\'ll find that highlanders aren\'t as easy to catch flat footed as they might think.','70124'),
('92529','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','What is this? A new acolyte seeking to serve the windlord sent by sister Sania? Truly we are blessed by the touch of the four winds this day!

We welcome all who seek to bask in the blessings of Al\'Akir.','70124'),
('92544','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','It was all I could do to stop myself from going over and joining you from my position here. I can only hope that these louts got the message and clear out of here soon. 

Thank you, $c. You have the gratitude of the Rangers of Thendal Grove.','70124'),
('92553','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','These eggs aren\'t easy to get but wind save me, they are DELICIOUS fried up in a bit of ursera tallow.

If you\'ve got a bit of time to spare and you enjoy cooking, I can teach you a few tips and tricks I\'ve picked up. Say the word and I\'d be happy to train you.','70124'),
('92595','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','I think you now understand how important the mission of the Windshapers is. Every soul who commands the skysight is of vital importance if we hope to establish dialogue with the spirits of the winds once again.

Between threats from within such as the Al\'Aketh, and the uncertainty of our safety here in Skywall, it is our responsibility as Windshapers to use our gifts to save our home and ensure that the Shen\'dorei can survive these trying times.','70124'),
('92598','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Like a muscle, your skysight must be exercised if you hope to grow stronger in the gift. Leveraging your skysight to bridge the distance between the mortal and the spiritual may prove invaluable to you in your adventures.

You\'d do well to remember what you\'ve learned here today. Our ability to use our gifts to hear what the elements tell us could be the key to our survival.','70124'),
('93036','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Greetings child, my name is Sania Silverstream and I am a junior priestess in the Order of the Al\'Aketh. Do you wish to learn more of our sovereign, the Windlord Al\'Akir?

There is always room at the Windlord\'s table for the righteous and the repentant.','70124'),
('93318','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','If we didn\'t have enough on our plates between the cult and the highlands bandits, we don\'t need a giant vuldren terrorizing our citizens as well. You\'ve done a great thing here today. As promised, here is your reward.','70124'),
('93319','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thanks $c. This should help us get by for now. If we can\'t get the supply routes squared away soon though, a few stolen windstones will be the least of our worries.','70124'),
('93552','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you very much for these. As elves we all have a deep connection to magic and these windstones are becoming more and more precious as the magic imbued into this island by the great anchor pylons continues to fade. 

Windstones aren\'t the only beneficial thing you can harvest from the land. Please, take one of these manuals.','70124'),
('93951','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','It might seem a bit of a vain triviality, gathering feathers for our hair. However, even in times like these, one needs to embrace the small joys as much as possible. 

If one thing I create brings someone joy, then I will consider that to be a good day. Thank you for bringing me these and helping me bring some joy to Zephras.','70124'),
('94411','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Direct conflict with our shen\'dorei brothers and sisters only weakens us as a people, but decisive action must at times be taken to prevent greater tragedy.

The mages of the High Order have zero regard for the consequences of their magical meddling. The forces that bind our island are fragile and vulnerable and all it could take is one thoughtless action to destroy our home.','70124'),
('94414','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Thank you for taking a moment to share this with me. I will continue to watch over the grove, and ponder on the state of our homeland.','70124'),
('95998','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','So now that we\'ve learned the basics, why don\'t you go and learn a tradeskill from the trainers in the village nearby. They will also teach you how to create a camp fixture suitable to your new profession.','70124'),
('96626','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','With this, you\'ll be able to set up a camp anywhere out in the wilderness. What you\'ve learned is just the basics, so you won\'t be able to place too many furnishings around it.

Raise your cooking skill and you might just be able to learn to make even bigger fires.

You can also learn the basics of furnishing your campsites from other tradeskill trainers if you\'re savvy in their skills.','70124'),
('96627','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Well met!','70124'),
('97971','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.

Oh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.','70124');

