('8192','0','0','0','0','Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. $B$BThe first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin\'do and the Bloodlord.$B$BThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles.$B$BBring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!','0'),
('8193','0','0','0','0','Today between 2pm and 4pm we have a contest to determine who the greatest angler of them all is!   Just be the FIRST PERSON to bring me 40 Tastyfish fished from the Tastyfish schools found along the coast of Stranglethorn before anyone else does and you will be declared the Master Angler! $B$B If you are not the first person to bring me 40 fish, my apprentice here will still reward you with money for each 5 Tastyfish you bring her.$B$B Oh, and don\'t delay, Tastyfish go bad quickly!
','0'),
('8194','0','0','0','0','Even though we already have a contest winner, I will still buy your Tastyfish from you at a reasonable price.   Whadda ya say!','0'),
('8195','1','1','0','0','I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes.  They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul\'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo.$B$BThere are nine distinct kinds to be found.  Some are sought after by my compatriots for various armors they offer Zandalar heroes.  Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three.  You may use the Tokens with Rin\'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.','0'),
('8196','1','1','0','0','The extremely potent essence mango grows across many of the islands in the South Seas.  A single mango will refresh those who eat it, both physically and mentally.  If you\'ve never had one, you do yourself a disservice!$B$BWe have enough of a supply here on the isle to offer you a handful in exchange for a Zandalar Honor Token.  Speak with Vinchaxa if you need to learn how to get tokens; otherwise, let\'s get to the business at hand!','0'),
('8201','6','6','0','0','Do you have the collection of heads, $N?  We must stop Hakkar from gaining more power!','0'),
('8221','0','0','0','0','*Whir* *Click*$B$B  I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue.   If you bring me a Keefer\'s Angelfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. $B$B *Zzzap* *Whir*','0'),
('8222','1','1','0','0','In all my time working the Faire, I\'ve learned a lot of things about customers.  Here\'s one of those nuggets of wisdom: customers love stuff that glows!  It doesn\'t matter what it is - you could take a broken chair leg and make it glow, and every child will come from miles around to get one!$B$BSo, $N, I need glowing scorpid blood.  You can find it from the scorpids of Sillithus, or the Blasted Lands, or the Burning Steppes.','0'),
('8224','0','0','0','0','*Whir* *Click*$B$B  I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue.   If you bring me a Dezian Queenfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. $B$B *Zzzap* *Whir*','0'),
('8225','0','0','0','0','*Whir* *Click*$B$B  I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue.   If you bring me a Brownell\'s Blue Striped Racer, I will provide you with this fine reward. $B$B *Zzzap* *Whir*','0'),
('8235','0','0','0','0','Have you found enough fragments to continue my work?','0'),
('8238','1','1','0','0','I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes.  They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul\'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo.$B$BThere are nine distinct kinds to be found.  Some are sought after by my compatriots for various armors they offer Zandalar heroes.  Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three.  You may use the Tokens with Rin\'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.','0'),
('8239','1','1','0','0','I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes.  They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul\'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo.$B$BThere are nine distinct kinds to be found.  Some are sought after by my compatriots for various armors they offer Zandalar heroes.  Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three.  You may use the Tokens with Rin\'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.','0'),
('8240','6','6','0','0','Have you destroyed the bijou at the Altar of Zanza?  Do so, and then you will be doubly blessed by Zanza!','0'),
('8242','0','0','0','0','Let\'s not waste more of my precious time with jibber jabber, $r. It\'s time to focus on replenishing our dwindling fiery flux supply.$B$BWhat I\'m gonna need from you is the following:$B$B*Incendosaur scales.$B$B*Heavy Leather.$B$B*Coal.$B$BI\'ll take all that you can offer!$B$BAnd you\'ll do it fast if you wanna get in good with the Brotherhood.
','0'),
('8243','1','1','0','0','With your increased status amongst the tribe comes access to some of our more potent potables.  Behold... these brews are strong in the mojo - blessed by Zanza and fit for adventurers from all walks of life!$B$BI will allow you to choose one from the three I offer; in exchange, I require one Zandalar Honor Token.  Note that only the effects of a single one may course through your spirit at any given time.$B$BLet me know when you\'re ready to barter!','0'),
('8246','1','0','0','0','$n - for someone as exalted among the Zandalar as you are, I have something very special for you. Direct from our home in the South Seas... the Signets of the Zandalar! These signets are used to enhance any shoulder item you may possess. Should you seek might, mojo, or serenity - I have what you need!$b$bI ask for fifteen Zandalar Honor Tokens in exchange for your choice of one signet. If you have the tokens ready, then I\'m ready to make a deal!','0'),
('8249','1','1','0','0','My rogues need to hone their lockpicking skills, and I need locks of adequate difficulty -- the stuff Zan makes us is unfit for all but the lowliest neophytes.$b$bTell ya what, if you bring me 5 Heavy Junkboxes, I\'ll provide you with some of the finest throwing knives known to roguekind.$b$bYou can unlock the boxes and rifle through them, but you\'ll have to leave at least a few coins in them... even a rogue in training needs motivation.','0'),
('8258','6','6','0','0','Time is critical, $N - have you succeeded in stopping Death Knight Darkreaver\'s threat?','0'),
('8266','1','0','0','0','I understand that it can be difficult at times to come out on top in Warsong Gulch. Still, your effort on our behalf - even when victory is not achieved - is important.$B$BShould you complete one of the trials inside Warsong Gulch and not achieve victory, you will still receive a Ribbons of Sacrifice. Bring it to me so that the Sentinels may reward you for acting on our behalf... even if you weren\'t able to win this time.','0'),
('8268','1','0','0','0','I understand that it can be difficult at times to come out on top in Warsong Gulch. Still, your effort on our behalf - even when victory is not achieved - is important.$B$BShould you complete one of the trials inside Warsong Gulch and not achieve victory, you will still receive a Ribbons of Sacrifice. Bring it to me so that the Outriders may reward you for acting on our behalf... even if you weren\'t able to win this time.','0'),
('8277','0','0','0','0','Are you done collecting those samples?  We could lose Noggle any minute now!','0'),
('8278','0','0','0','0','This is our last chance to save Noggle!  Hurry!','0'),
('8279','0','0','0','0','Who goes there?  Oh, it\'s you!  Did you find all the Lexicon chapters yet?','0'),
('8280','0','0','0','0','The dredge strikers are a serious threat and must be dealt with quickly!','0'),
('8281','0','0','0','0','The dredge crushers are a serious threat and must be dealt with at once!','0'),
('8282','0','0','0','0','Still haven\'t found my bag?  Well I should count my lucky stars, at least the poison\'s been cleansed.','0'),
('8283','0','0','0','0','I\'ll need the creature\'s pincer as proof of the deed.  No pincer, no reward.','0'),
('8284','0','0','0','0','The ravaged camp can be found northwest of here.  Come back when you have all the fragments.','0'),
('8286','6','6','0','0','Has Anachronos returned?','0'),
('8287','0','0','0','0','What is this you bring to me, $N?','0'),
('8291','1','0','0','0','Have you fought in Warsong Gulch and defended Silverwing Hold?','0'),
('8292','1','0','0','0','You earned credit for your last task. Bring me more Marks of Honor, and be rewarded.','0'),
('8293','1','0','0','0','You earned credit for your last task. Bring me more Marks of Honor, and be rewarded.','0'),
('8297','1','0','0','0','Do you have the Marks of Honor, $N? The League of Arathor can\'t fight a decent battle without them...','0'),
('8298','1','0','0','0','$N, the League of Arathor has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more Marks of Honor and bring them to me.','0'),
('8299','1','0','0','0','What is it, $R? Do you have the Marks of Honor? Go back to Arathi Basin, slay the Alliance vermine and take possession of its ressources for the Dark Lady!','0'),
('8300','1','0','0','0','$N, the Defilers has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more marks of honor and bring them to me.','0'),
('8301','1','0','0','0','There is much history rooted in their distrust of the mortal races; but alas, such is a tale better left for the Brood to tell when the time is right.','0'),
('8302','1','0','0','0','Perhaps one day the whole of Cenarion Hold will be working under your command.','0'),
('8304','5','5','0','0','Waste no time, $N!','0'),
('8306','6','6','0','0','Natalia?','0'),
('8308','274','274','0','0','Oh dear.','0'),
('8309','1','1','0','0','If you find some crazy night elf lass in one of the hives, be sure to give her a kick in the duff for us.','0'),
('8310','25','25','0','0','Go play with the monkey, kid. I don\'t have time for this. ','0'),
('8311','1','1','0','0','Have you finished trick-or-treating yet?  I\'m sad that I can\'t go because I\'m sick, but you helping me out makes me feel a little better...','0'),
('8312','1','1','0','0','Have you finished trick-or-treating yet?  I\'m sad that I can\'t go because I\'m sick, but you helping me out makes me feel a little better...','0'),
('8313','1','0','0','0','Did you learn the recipe?  You won\'t keep it to yourself, I hope!','0'),
('8314','6','6','0','0','Oh my! What do you have there, $N?','0'),
('8315','1','1','0','0','You must take the opportunity as it presents itself and strike!','0'),
('8317','1','0','0','0','How are those dumplings coming along? ','0'),
('8318','6','6','0','0','Did you bring me some texts?','0'),
('8320','5','5','0','0','Enter the desert and find the Twilight geolords, $N.  Return to me after they are slain.','0'),
('8321','6','6','0','0','$N, have you yet defeated Vyral the Vile?  Do you have his signet ring?','0'),
('8322','0','0','0','0','The keg is filled with ale.','0'),
('8323','0','0','0','0','Did you find any encrypted texts?  I\'m quite curious to read this month\'s True Believer.','0'),
('8332','6','6','0','0','Do you have the shard and the crests, $N?  I will need them to make the twilight cultist\'s medallion of station.','0'),
('8333','0','0','0','0','If you need another Twilight cultist\'s medallion of station, then I am happy to oblige. I will, however, need another brilliant shard and some abyssal crests...','0'),
('8341','1','0','0','0','Do you have the shards and the signets, $N? I will need them to create the ring of lordship. ','0'),
('8348','1','0','0','0','How did it go with the Abyssal Duke? Did it hit hard?','0'),
('8352','1','0','0','0','Well, how did it go? I\'d do anything to leave my post and wrestle one of those things myself!','0'),
('8353','25','25','0','0','I\'m waiting...','0'),
('8354','25','25','0','0','I\'m waiting...','0'),
('8355','11','11','0','0','Well, go ahead now...','0'),
('8356','1','1','0','0','No candy until you flex for me, $N...','0'),
('8357','6','6','0','0','You know how to dance, don\'t you?  Try by putting your right foot in... then your right foot out... your right foot in... shake it all about...','0'),
('8358','6','6','0','0','Well, go ahead now...','0'),
('8359','1','1','0','0','No candy until you flex for me, $N...','0'),
('8360','6','6','0','0','You know how to dance, don\'t you?  Try by putting your right foot in... then your right foot out... your right foot in... shake it all about...','0'),
('8361','0','0','0','0','Did you finish the job?','0'),
('8362','0','0','0','0','You\'ve proved you can handle yourself in a fight, $N. Let\'s keep the pressure up on the Twilight\'s Hammer. Go fight some more Abyssal Templars, I\'ll reward you with some of the stuff Huum and I have found in battle.','0'),
('8363','0','0','0','0','You\'ve shown you\'re more than capable of taking on an Abyssal Duke, $N. I\'m always one to promote good habits. Bring me more signets and I\'ll give you a reward.','0'),
('8364','0','0','0','0','You\'ve truly exceeded all my expectations, $N. You\'ve been taking on opponents that Huum and I would think long and hard before engaging.$B$BAt this point the best I can do is to continue rewarding your efforts in the fight against the Twilight\'s Hammer and their overlords.$B$BBring me more abyssal scepters and I\'ll do my best to give you a suitable reward.','0'),
('8366','6','6','0','0','Back so soon?  I hope you taught those Southsea hoodlums a lesson they won\'t soon forget.','0'),
('8368','0','0','0','0','Do you bear news from Warsong Gulch, $N?','0'),
('8369','0','0','0','0','What news do you bring from the lands of the Frostwolves?  How does the battle for Alterac Valley fare?','0'),
('8370','0','0','0','0','You\'ve come back with news from Arathi, $c?','0'),
('8371','0','0','0','0','How are yer travels faring $g laddie:lass;?','0'),
('8372','1','0','0','0','You\'ve come back with news from the front, $N?','0'),
('8373','15','15','0','0','Those blasted Forsaken... it\'s already bad enough that they\'re undead, but then they get all riled up and start causing trouble in MY village!','0'),
('8374','0','0','0','0','Tell me, what are the news from the front?','0'),
('8375','0','0','0','0','What news do you bring, $N?','0'),
('8383','0','0','0','0','The Battle in Alterac Valley rages on, $N!  Have you done your part as of late, $N?','0'),
('8384','1','0','0','0','The war against the Horde is quickly depleting our supplies, $n.  It is vital to maintain control of Arathi Basin to keep the stream of resources flowing!  Have you lent a hand in Arathi yet?','0'),
('8385','0','0','0','0','Ah, $N.  I hope you continue to lend your experience to the different battlefronts.  A lot of our lads and lasses in the field look up to seasoned veterans like you.','0'),
('8386','1','0','0','0','Don\'t forget the fight for Warsong Gulch is about more than just protecting trees.  It\'s about keeping a natural barrier between Ashenvale and the Barrens.  Do you bring any news from the battlefield, $n?','0'),
('8387','0','0','0','0','The battle for Alterac rages on!  You must return to Alterac Valley and once more drive the invaders out of Frostwolf territory, $N!','0'),
('8388','1','1','0','0','Many brave fighters look up to you, $N.  You continue to be an example for all in the fight against the Alliance.  What news do you bring from your journeys?','0'),
('8389','0','0','0','0','The battle in Warsong Gulch rages on, $N.  Do your part to drive the Silverwing Sentinels out of our lands!','0'),
('8390','0','0','0','0','The war against the Alliance scum demands resources, $N! We cannot allow our stockpiles to run dry in the middle of a battle.  Continue to ensure Arathi Basin remains in our hands! ','0'),
('8391','1','0','0','0','The war against the Horde is quickly depleting our supplies, $n.  It is vital to maintain control of Arathi Basin to keep the stream of resources flowing!  Have you lent a hand in Arathi yet?','0'),
