('8410','0','0','0','0','What you got for me, $c?','0'),
('8412','1','1','0','0','The spirits know what we\'re up to, and they been tryin\' to kill me!  I hope you got the parts.','0'),
('8413','6','6','0','0','Where\'s the feathers, mon?','0'),
('8414','6','6','0','0','What evil have you brought me?','0'),
('8416','6','6','0','0','Was Thal\'danis able to cleanse the scourgestones?','0'),
('8418','0','0','0','0','Have you slain the wretched trolls?','0'),
('8419','6','6','0','0','Do you have my felcloth?','0'),
('8420','6','6','0','0','Do you have my felcloth?','0'),
('8421','6','6','0','0','Do you have the goods?','0'),
('8422','6','6','0','0','Did you bring the feathers?  This doll needs stuffed!','0'),
