('8819','1','1','0','0','I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty.  For each set of ten that you hand to me, I\'ll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Darnassus.  I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition.  We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.$B$BWith that said, I\'ll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.','0'),
