('9422','0','0','0','0','Be wary of the dangers of the desert, $n. With the Alliance lurking in the dunes, any step could be your last.','0'),
('9665','1','1','0','0','They must be fools to think that we would allow them to establish bases so close to one of our capitals.$b$bWe will bleed their numbers until they turn tail and retreat back to the south.','0'),
('92461','0','0','0','0','As unsavory as it is to need to cull living creatures, this type of guiding hand is needed to avert disaster in our homeland. This is an important lesson for one such as yourself to learn.','70124'),
